	('Mom gets mad','Mẹ rất tức giận','00:00:03.990','00:00:05.810','esl-fast-beginner-1-5'),
	('She thinks he is lazy','Mẹ nghĩ cậu bé lười biếng','00:00:06.170','00:00:08.600','esl-fast-beginner-1-5'),
