	('He looks at the list','Cậu bé nhìn vào danh sách','00:00:14.390','00:00:16.100','esl-fast-beginner-1-5'),
	('He has to clean the floors','Cậu bé phải lau sàn nhà','00:00:16.450','00:00:18.950','esl-fast-beginner-1-5'),
